msgid "Automatic imaging layer proposal"
msgstr "Automatic imaging layer proposal"

#: templates/views/components/functions/imaging-layers-proposal.htm:7
msgid ""
"When a chemical imaging manifest is saved, each of its\n"
"            canvases without a layer description receives one, proposed from the\n"
"            canvas label: an element symbol, a spectral band, a video frame or a\n"
"            deconvolved element map."
msgstr ""
"When a chemical imaging manifest is saved, each of its\n"
"            canvases without a layer description receives one, proposed from the\n"
"            canvas label: an element symbol, a spectral band, a video frame or a\n"
"            deconvolved element map."

#: templates/views/components/functions/imaging-layers-proposal.htm:13
msgid "An existing layer is never modified."
msgstr "An existing layer is never modified."

#: templates/views/components/functions/imaging-layers-proposal.htm:14
msgid ""
"Canvases whose label is not recognised are left\n"
"            without a layer. Layers are proposed only when a manifest is first\n"
"            saved or its URL changes, so a layer deleted afterwards stays\n"
"            deleted. Nothing is proposed for an edit awaiting review, and a\n"
"            failure is logged without blocking the save."
msgstr ""
"Canvases whose label is not recognised are left\n"
"            without a layer. Layers are proposed only when a manifest is first\n"
"            saved or its URL changes, so a layer deleted afterwards stays\n"
"            deleted. Nothing is proposed for an edit awaiting review, and a\n"
"            failure is logged without blocking the save."

#: templates/views/components/functions/imaging-layers-proposal.htm:21
msgid ""
"Layers of analyses recorded before this function\n"
"            existed are filled once by a maintenance script."
msgstr ""
"Layers of analyses recorded before this function\n"
"            existed are filled once by a maintenance script."

#: templates/views/components/functions/imaging-layers-proposal.htm:25
msgid ""
"A resource imported from Arches JSON with its layer\n"
"            tiles may receive duplicate layers: the manifest tile is saved\n"
"            before its layers, and the function cannot see them."
msgstr ""
"A resource imported from Arches JSON with its layer\n"
"            tiles may receive duplicate layers: the manifest tile is saved\n"
"            before its layers, and the function cannot see them."

